{"quest_id": 8741, "name": "狭間の雪原の王", "description": "最強の雪原王を決める最後の戦いが始まる。\n＜魔力嵐(弱)：出撃時の初期HP減少(小)\n　爆風範囲、魔法ダメージが減少＞\n神級（★１獲得の目安：平均覚醒Lv25）", "modifier_notes": ["魔力嵐(弱)：出撃時の初期HP減少(小)\n　爆風範囲、魔法ダメージが減少"], "event": "雪原に立つ新たなる王者", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920239, "map_no": 7303, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 150, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 50, "params": [80]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 22, "params": [80]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 9, "params": [20], "expression": "!IsPlayerSupportUnit();", "expression_human": "it is not a borrowed support unit"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 4, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1700, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 5, "attack_wait": 65, "attack_interval": 200, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2162128, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 2152, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 39291, "global_id": 12908, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 12909, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 4, "tags": ["黒輪"], "hp": 140000, "attack": 2000, "base_hp": 140000, "base_attack": 2000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1000, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 5, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 160, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2162128, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 2153, "change_to": 2, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 39292, "global_id": 12909, "from_condition": 2, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 12910}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 2, "form_count": 4, "tags": ["黒輪"], "hp": 280000, "attack": 3500, "base_hp": 280000, "base_attack": 3500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2000, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 5, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 68, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2162144, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 2154, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 4, "master_id": 39293, "global_id": 12910, "from_condition": 2, "to_condition": 4, "to_ticks": 1, "to_global_id": 12911}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 3, "form_count": 4, "tags": ["黒輪"], "hp": 280000, "attack": 5000, "base_hp": 280000, "base_attack": 5000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2000, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 5, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 144, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2162160, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 2074, "change_to": 2, "change_condition": 4, "master_id": 39294, "global_id": 12911, "from_condition": 4, "trigger_ticks": 1}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 9, "level": 120, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 550, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 550, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 800, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 116, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098496, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 100, "global_id": 99, "spawn_sec": 97}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 14, "level": 120, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2400, "attack": 650, "base_hp": 2400, "base_attack": 650, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2000, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2097472, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 24, "global_id": 23, "spawn_sec": 113}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 22, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 60, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 35, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2162320, "race_id": 11, "special_effect_id": 229, "missile_id": 8, "missile": {"speed": 6.0}, "master_id": 38997, "global_id": 12614, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 135}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 7, "level": 120, "form_count": 1, "hp": 7000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 7000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2200, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 600.0, "dot_rate": 2.0, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099136, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 645, "global_id": 644, "spawn_sec": 154}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 20, "level": 130, "form_count": 2, "hp": 16000, "attack": 900, "base_hp": 16000, "base_attack": 900, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 5, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 202, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2162096, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 2150, "change_to": 9, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 39010, "global_id": 12627, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 12628, "spawn_sec": 160}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 130, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 16000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 16000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "true", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 5, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 216, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2162112, "race_id": 12, "special_effect_id": 2151, "master_id": 39011, "global_id": 12628, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 11, "source": "local", "count": 7, "level": 130, "form_count": 1, "hp": 30000, "attack": 1100, "base_hp": 30000, "base_attack": 1100, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103568, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 456, "global_id": 455, "spawn_sec": 178}, {"enemy_id": 12, "source": "local", "count": 10, "level": 130, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 45000, "attack": 1800, "base_hp": 45000, "base_attack": 1800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1200, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2128592, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 33700, "global_id": 7317, "spawn_sec": 200}, {"enemy_id": 13, "source": "local", "count": 10, "level": 130, "form_count": 1, "hp": 70000, "attack": 2500, "base_hp": 70000, "base_attack": 2500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108064, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 972, "global_id": 971, "spawn_sec": 254}], "popups": ["白き獣人の騎士は倒されると\n黒い光冠を纏い\nその場で強くなって復活します。\n復活は2回まで行われます。\n\n\n\n　　　　　　(1/2)", "2回復活した後の\n白き獣人の騎士は、\n攻撃を受けると\n即座に麻痺状態になる\n物理の近接攻撃と、\n高威力の物理の近接攻撃を\n交互に行います。\n　　　　　　(2/2)"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ファオル", "text": "この前の獣人戦士たち……！？", "face": "u2513a1"}, {"name": "獣人の騎士？", "text": "南の人間どもが雪原王になって、\n何の文句もねぇとか嘘だろ？\nどれだけいい子ちゃんなんだよ、テメェら！", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "雪原王が獣人でなければならない、\nなどという掟は存在しないメー。", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "獣人の騎士？", "text": "誇りはねぇのかって言ってんだよ！\n強けりゃいいなら、\nギルガメッシュが雪原王でも良いんだな！？", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "マータン", "text": "誘拐犯に言われたくないな。\n里の皆をさらっていったくせに！", "face": "u2524a1"}, {"name": "獣人の騎士？", "text": "チィッ……テメェらがのほほんと\n自分の里だけ守ってやがるからだ。", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "獣人の騎士？", "text": "オレたちだって先祖はよそ者だ。\nだがなァ、獣人の誇りは！　失っちゃいねぇ！", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "我ら始祖たる白き獅子の血を引く者！\n王子、テメェに勝負を挑むぞ！\nグオァァァァァァァァッグ！！", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "……ああ、なるほど、そういうことか。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ユリクセス", "text": "訳知り顔している暇があったら説明しろ。", "face": "u2193a1"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "痛っ、は、発言する前に蹴るのはズルくないかい？\n――南方諸国の伝承に、白き獅子の獣人、\nそしてその騎士団の物語が残っているんだ。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "強さこそを至上のものとし、\n武力によって外敵を排除し続ける武装集団。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "自分たち以上の力を持つ侵略者が現れた時には、\n周辺部族から見込みのある子をさらい、\n戦士として育てあげ、仲間に組み入れていたらしい。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ユリクセス", "text": "ただの人さらいじゃないか。", "face": "u2193a1"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "まぁ、それはそうなんだけどね。\nしかし彼らが辺り一帯の治安を守っていたのも事実だ。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "その彼らが、なぜ狭間の雪原に？", "face": "lff9d72b5c4d9"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "……獣人狩りだよ。\n毛皮を目的に、いくつかの国が\n国家規模で彼らの里を駆逐した。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "大義名分は人さらいの征伐。\n誰も、彼らを助けようとはしなかったそうだよ。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ユリクセス", "text": "……自業自得だ。", "face": "u2193a1"}, {"name": "ガレア", "text": "後世の僕らだから、そう言える。\nでも、彼らもまた生きるためにそれを選んだはずだ。", "face": "u2459a1"}, {"name": "ユリクセス", "text": "ふん……。", "face": "u2193a1"}, {"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "――剣を取れ、王子ィ！\nテメェも負かしてオレの一族に加えてやる！", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "グオァァァァァァァァッグッ！！", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "グッ、ゴホッ……くそっ……。", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "アヴリック", "text": "――しょ、勝者！　王子ぃー！！\n雪原王決定戦、勝者は王子です！！", "face": "u2443a1"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "異議なしメーッ！", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "三百年ぶりの上級王！\n我らが雪原王を承認するぜ！", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "クルーナ", "text": "銀狼の群れを率いる者！\nかっこいい師匠を雪原王に！", "face": "u2613a1"}, {"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "――認めねぇッ！\n死ねっ、王子ぃぃぃぃぃぃッ！！", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "オヴィー", "text": "……見苦しいな。お前たちの流儀では、\n勝負に負けたら軍門に下るんだろう？　――ふんッ！！", "face": "lb8f1b0b33ba3"}, {"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "ぐげっ！？", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "白き獣人の騎士", "text": "…………。", "face": "leebe82e6609b"}, {"name": "オヴィー", "text": "よし、静かになったな。", "face": "lb8f1b0b33ba3"}, {"name": "オヴィー", "text": "我ら、雪枝の里も新たな雪原王を歓迎する！", "face": "lb8f1b0b33ba3"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "オヴィー", "text": "雪原に生きる者たちよ！\n狭間の雪原は今、未曾有の危機にある！", "face": "lb8f1b0b33ba3"}, {"name": "クルーナ", "text": "よそ者――ギルガメッシュの軍勢が、\n雪原のあちこちで戦力を拡大してるんだ！", "face": "u2613a1"}, {"name": "ユキヒツジの族長", "text": "安住の地は、自分たちの手で守らなければならないメー。", "face": "l4bb9b565c5f2"}, {"name": "セイウチの族長", "text": "野郎ども！\n三百年ぶりの大同盟だ！\n雪原王のもと、我らが父祖の大地を守り抜くぞ！", "face": "lc67f09778af3"}, {"name": "クルーナ", "text": "えい、えい、おーっ！！", "face": "u2613a1"}]}], "active": true}